Someone asked why they kept getting tins of rotten meat when they used their
tinning kit.  Now, It's possible it was cursed, I don't know what would
happen if it was.  The more likely explanation is that, I think, if you tin
a rotten corpse you get a tin of rotten meat.  Thus, it's not necessarily a
good thing to cruise into a zoo, kill everything, and then go tin the
corpses, 'cause if the zoo took long enough to clean out, chances are that
you are gonna get some rotten tins.
